   "detailed_description": "<h1>Chapter V</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/073a8320eb524747e9aa31b77c7e58e8.avif?t=1791471575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras_big/073a8320eb524747e9aa31b77c7e58e8.webp?t=1791471575 width=1560 height=2188 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Starter Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/3614024e6dc31bf6a2c1c86043508d8c.avif?t=1791471575\" width=616 height=766 /></span></p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/42383f01893a8267762ba1055210a6e7.avif?t=1791471575\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您的地位正等著您。選擇您的貴族家族，在跨越世代的中世紀史詩中率領您的王朝茁壯發展。戰爭只是建立統治的眾多工具之一，因為真正的戰略需要專業的外交技巧、對領土的掌握和真正的<i>狡猾心思</i>。<strong>《Crusader Kings III》</strong>延續 Paradox Development Studio 所推出的熱門遊戲系列，是一款集結廣受好評沉浸式大型戰略與深度、戲劇性中世紀角色扮演的作品。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/897f130c0b80d9c435162d4256292243.poster.avif?t=1791471575\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/897f130c0b80d9c435162d4256292243.webm?t=1791471575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/897f130c0b80d9c435162d4256292243.mp4?t=1791471575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/ddeab03917baad646888fd08a5eb0dbc.webp?t=1791471575\" width=615 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 仔細研究中世紀，掌握您的家族並擴展您的王朝。始於西元 867、1066 或 1178 年，獲得領土、頭銜與附庸國，鞏固配得上您皇室血脈的王國。無論您的離世是否在計劃之內，都不影響大局，您的血統會由新的可遊玩角色所繼承。 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 探索一個龐大的模擬世界，有著農民和騎士、朝臣、間諜、流氓與小丑，也別忘了還有秘密戀情。可以浪漫化、背叛、處決或巧妙地影響大量的歷史人物。 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 探索一幅廣闊的中世紀地圖，從白雪覆蓋的北歐大陸延伸至非洲之角，從西部的不列顛群島延伸到東部富有異國情調的緬甸。占領、征服並統治數以千計獨特的郡地、公國、王國和帝國。 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/512802bb26f28bc1f08d749bb4af32a2.poster.avif?t=1791471575\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/512802bb26f28bc1f08d749bb4af32a2.webm?t=1791471575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/512802bb26f28bc1f08d749bb4af32a2.mp4?t=1791471575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/5699a15edaa86b755886b5928123a940.webp?t=1791471575\" width=615 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 每個角色都不同凡響，其特性與生活風格的選擇決定了各自的行動和計畫。當您以鐵腕手段統治，或表現寬宏大量激勵人民時，會引發恐懼。基因會遺傳給後代子孫，無論是聰明才智或是愚昧無知。 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 讓合適的監護人來培養您的繼承人或親自教育他們。若有需要，安排聯姻或透過其他方法派他們出去。 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 從外觀到特性自訂您的統治者與貴族家族，打造一個配得上所繼承之所有美德和惡習的君主。 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/40cd9b36945550c1928df592e7cda8da.poster.avif?t=1791471575\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/40cd9b36945550c1928df592e7cda8da.webm?t=1791471575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/40cd9b36945550c1928df592e7cda8da.mp4?t=1791471575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/bed5c711c4b317e374c9b12349a60512.webp?t=1791471575\" width=615 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 統治一個不斷發展的王國，授予您認為合適的頭銜；或篡其位並自行稱王。小心提防對手，無論是不安分的農奴或意欲報復的妃嬪。 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 暗影經常蠢蠢欲動，危險潛伏於每一個黑暗的角落。招募特工和其他討人厭的元素來破壞、敲詐勒索或謀殺那些擋路之人。或受吟遊詩人和民謠的啟發，用自己的方式獲得權力和影響力。 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 將會血流成河。集結披甲戰士單位和英勇的騎士。管理您的戰場戰術和軍隊。突襲、掠奪鄰近土地，或延攬傭兵和教團在大規模衝突中協助您。 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/b7d5e3c082d88ec1c55709c8a3306eb8.poster.avif?t=1791471575\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/b7d5e3c082d88ec1c55709c8a3306eb8.webm?t=1791471575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/b7d5e3c082d88ec1c55709c8a3306eb8.mp4?t=1791471575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/7a9763af4b91f8d679e9f24d0a07227a.webp?t=1791471575\" width=615 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 當一個虔誠的國王，讓宗教的力量為您所用；或自行開創新的信仰，就此千古流芳或遺臭萬年。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 為您的文化帶來新穎的創新，建造強大的城堡和堡壘，以增加麾下領土的財富、聲望和安全。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 可遵循的道路近乎無限：體驗數以千計的動態事件和改變生活的決定，適合各種可想像的情況和性格。有無數方法可以確保並維持您在歷史書籍中的位置。</p></li></ul>",
